# Expected sha256 of every pinned open-steamgate asset: "<sha256>  <tag>/<asset>".
# Checked by osd-up.sh before a binary is made executable, in addition to the
# release's own .sha256. Update together with osd.version / osgo.version:
#   gh release download <tag> -R oisee/open-steamgate -p 'osd-*' -p 'osgo-*' -D dl
#   then hash every binary in dl (not the .sha256 files), check each against
#   its release .sha256, and write the lines below with the new tag.
